Subject: gui-extensions/file: download button in the file view

The web app could show a file but not save it. Media, documents and other artifacts get
"Download" in their toolbar; plain text files a download icon in the top corner. It reads the
file again through the session's server (the loaded copy is decoded text, or empty for large and
unknown binaries), so it works for any server, not only the one serving the app.

Ocelot-Patch: web/file-download

